# QA Q2 (fixed in T20b): a pointer resting (not moving) over the window must not steal the
# keyboard/gamepad focus when a new screen appears under it (focus follows pointer motion only). hover_steal.sh parks the pointer over the Settings "Hints" row's
# position (empty space in the main menu) before the game starts.
wait ui
wait screen title
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # Title
wait screen main
1.5 shot hs_01_main
0.3 nav keyboardA up
0.3 nav keyboardA up
0.3 nav keyboardA up               # Settings
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait screen settings
1.0 shot hs_02_settings_opened     # expected: focus on Speed units (row 0)
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # expected: km/h → mph
1.0 shot hs_03_after_right
0.3 nav keyboardA back
1.0 exit
